stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Paid : pay
    Draft --> Cancelled : cancel
    Paid --> Shipped : ship
    Paid --> Cancelled : cancel
    Shipped --> Closed : deliver
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]
